{"sections":{"trust_badges_9gmyJV":{"type":"trust-badges","blocks":{"badge_tG7zjc":{"type":"badge","settings":{"before_text":"","highlight_text":"Gratis verzending","after_text":"vanaf €50"}},"badge_tE83TY":{"type":"badge","disabled":true,"settings":{"before_text":"Professionele","highlight_text":"kwaliteit","after_text":""}},"badge_HfH9GJ":{"type":"badge","settings":{"before_text":"Altijd de","highlight_text":"scherpste prijs","after_text":""}},"badge_kRCcLB":{"type":"badge","settings":{"before_text":"","highlight_text":"Beoordeling 9,5","after_text":"(Webwinkelkeur)"}}},"block_order":["badge_tG7zjc","badge_tE83TY","badge_HfH9GJ","badge_kRCcLB"],"name":"Trust Badges","settings":{"margin_top":16,"margin_bottom":16}},"breadcrumbs_section_yDtij4":{"type":"breadcrumbs-section","disabled":true,"name":"Breadcrumbs Section","settings":{}},"image_with_text_jDm8tA":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_RLFA9b":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"{{ collection.title }}","heading_size":"h1"}},"text_cAVLQe":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ collection.description }}","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_RLFA9b","text_cAVLQe"],"custom_css":[".image-with-text__grid {border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;}",".image-with-text__media {border: 0;}"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"custom-class":"custom-pdp-banner","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/185130_6cfedf6e-e749-49b2-aea1-88dfe2aa7f03.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"no-overlap","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"scheme-1","color_scheme":"scheme-2","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"rich_text_3NYrM4":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_HzF3RX":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Heb je last van optrekkend vocht in muren en zoek je een blijvende oplossing?","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_APiECC":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Optrekkend vocht veroorzaakt niet alleen vochtproblemen, maar ook aantasting van materialen en afwerking door hoge zoutconcentraties uit de bodem. Dit leidt tot bouwfysische achteruitgang van het gebouw, minder wooncomfort, geurhinder en mogelijk gezondheidsklachten.<\/p><p>Kiesol C [basic] is een oplosmiddelvrije silaancrème waarmee muren eenvoudig en snel geïnjecteerd worden. Werk systematisch volgens de aangegeven stappen hieronder om een betrouwbare vochtbarrière te creëren.<br\/><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_HzF3RX","text_APiECC"],"custom_css":[".rich-text__blocks {width: 100%; max-width: 100%;}",".rich-text__wrapper {width: 100%;}"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"custom-id":"","desktop_content_position":"left","content_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"image_with_text_pD7eky":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_RC9hb6":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Vloeren afdichten?","heading_size":"h1"}},"text_JRW7Aw":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h3>Wij doen het!<\/h3><p>In veel oude gebouwen zijn niet alleen de muren, maar ook de vloeren vaak vochtig en moeten deze worden afgedicht. Dat kan moeilijk van buitenaf gebeuren, het kan alleen van binnenuit worden gedaan. Een meerlagige, dikke structuur is echter vaak niet wenselijk omdat de plafondhoogte daardoor aanzienlijk afneemt.<\/p><p>Met Remmers WP Flow kunnen vloeren snel en eenvoudig afgedicht én geëgaliseerd worden, in één enkele laag. Zo besparen we tijd én geld.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_RC9hb6","text_JRW7Aw"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":[".image-with-text__grid {align-items: center;}",".image-with-text__media {border: 0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;}",".page-width {max-width: 1170px;}"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"custom-class":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/191171_f2569cc3-0643-492a-98fa-2c4d934d6eb5.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"small","layout":"image_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"no-overlap","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"product-grid":{"type":"main-collection-product-grid","settings":{"products_per_page":24,"columns_desktop":4,"columns_mobile":"2","color_scheme":"scheme-2","image_ratio":"adapt","image_shape":"default","show_secondary_image":false,"show_vendor":false,"show_rating":false,"quick_add":"none","enable_filtering":false,"filter_type":"vertical","enable_sorting":false,"padding_top":80,"padding_bottom":80}},"video_aQPwkk":{"type":"video","custom_css":[".page-width {max-width: 850px;}",".video-section__media {border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden !important;}"],"name":"t:sections.video.presets.name","settings":{"heading":"","heading_size":"h1","enable_video_looping":false,"video":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/Verfsale com Remmers Injectie tegen opstijgend vocht met Kiesol C basic  re edit Definitief.mp4","video_url":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/fxugNMxcCD0","description":"","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"","padding_top":80,"padding_bottom":80}},"banner":{"type":"main-collection-banner","disabled":true,"custom_css":[".collection-banner__title {font-size: 16px !important;}"],"settings":{"show_collection_description":false,"show_collection_image":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-1"}},"multicolumn_L4Hhmf":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"column_EbmKPd":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_1.png","sub_heading":"","title":"Stap 1: Boorgaten","text":"<ul><li>Boor horizontale gaten zo dicht mogelijk tegen de onderzijde van de constructie. Houd een onderlinge afstand van 12 cm aan en gebruik een boordiameter van 12 mm. <\/li><li>De boordiepte bedraagt de totale muurdikte minus 2 cm, zodat de gaten niet volledig worden doorboord. <br\/><\/li><\/ul>","link_label":"","link":""}},"column_NMnDQL":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2_1.png","sub_heading":"","title":"Stap 2: Reinigen boorgaten","text":"<ul><li>Maak de boorgaten stofvrij door ze grondig uit te blazen met perslucht middels een blaaspistool of schoon te zuigen met een stofzuiger. Dit zorgt voor optimale hechting van het te injecteren materiaal.<br\/><br\/><\/li><\/ul>","link_label":"","link":""}},"column_cTmCaa":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/3_1.png","sub_heading":"","title":"Stap 3: Injecteren","text":"<ul><li>Breng de werkzame stof <strong>Remmers Kiesol C [basic]<\/strong> in de boorgaten aan met de <strong>Gloriapomp  <\/strong>of een andere geschikte injectieset. Vul de gaten tot 2 cm onder het oppervlak om een optimale werking en hechting te garanderen. <\/li><li>Het verbruik is ca. 0,1 ltr <strong>Remmers Kiesol C [basic]<\/strong> per boorgat. Totaal aantal boorgaten per strekkende meter ongeveer 8,5. Verbuik ca. 0,85 ltr\/m1. <br\/><br\/><\/li><\/ul>","link_label":"","link":""}},"column_8j4kFi":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/4_1.png","sub_heading":"","title":"Stap 4: Dichtzetten boorgaten","text":"<ul><li>Sluit de boorgaten direct na het injecteren met de <strong>Remmers Kiesol C [basic]<\/strong> af met de <strong>Remmers WP DS Levell<\/strong>, zodat het materiaal goed kan uitharden en de boorgaten volledig worden afgesloten. Verbruik ca. 1,0 kg\/m1.<\/li><li>Hiervoor gebruik je een plamuurmes of spackmes.<\/li><\/ul>","link_label":"","link":""}},"column_NznzWc":{"type":"column","settings":{"sub_heading":"","title":"Stap 5: Optioneel: bijkomende maatregelen","text":"<ul><li>Na de injectie kan het nodig zijn om de huidige wandafwerking te herstellen of te saneren. Laat de ondergrond eerst goed drogen alvorens deze opnieuw wordt afgewerkt. <\/li><\/ul>","link_label":"","link":""}},"column_VLVN7G":{"type":"column","disabled":true,"settings"